      "prefix": "theorem actual_tail_moment_sum_factorial_bound (n r : ℕ) (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hr : r ≤ 4) :\n    (∑' m : ℕ, actualMomentTerm n r (m + 2 * n)) ≤\n      tailCoefficient n r / (2 * (n : ℝ)) ^ tailPower n r * (9 / 7 : ℝ) :=",
